### Для IntelliJ HTTP Client. Замените пароль ADMIN при необходимости.
@url = http://localhost:8080
@admin = admin
@adminPassword = change_this_admin_password
@guest = guest1
@guestPassword = Password123!

### Регистрация
POST {{url}}/api/users/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"guest1","email":"guest1@example.org","password":"Password123!","role":"USER"}

### Создание отеля
POST {{url}}/api/hotels
Authorization: Basic {{admin}} {{adminPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Aurora Hotel","advertisementTitle":"Комфорт в центре","city":"Москва","address":"Тверская, 10","distanceFromCenter":1.50}

### Список отелей с фильтрацией
GET {{url}}/api/hotels?city=Москва&page=0&size=10
Authorization: Basic {{guest}} {{guestPassword}}

### Создание номера
POST {{url}}/api/rooms
Authorization: Basic {{admin}} {{adminPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"title":"Комфорт","description":"Номер на двух гостей","roomNumber":"201","price":6800.00,"maxGuests":2,"hotelId":1,"unavailableDates":["2026-11-12"]}

### Фильтр свободных номеров
GET {{url}}/api/rooms?guestCount=2&checkIn=2026-11-02&checkOut=2026-11-05
Authorization: Basic {{guest}} {{guestPassword}}

### Бронирование
POST {{url}}/api/bookings
Authorization: Basic {{guest}} {{guestPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"roomId":1,"checkIn":"2026-11-02","checkOut":"2026-11-05"}

### Рейтинг
POST {{url}}/api/hotels/1/rating
Authorization: Basic {{guest}} {{guestPassword}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"mark":5}

### Список всех броней
GET {{url}}/api/bookings?page=0&size=20
Authorization: Basic {{admin}} {{adminPassword}}

### CSV
GET {{url}}/api/statistics/export
Authorization: Basic {{admin}} {{adminPassword}}
